  "decision": "Withdrawn",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development would present a substandard quality of accommodation. Its layout would conflict with the functionality as a family sized unit. No double bedspaces are proposed, and the harm caused by way of a reduction in the borough&#39;s supply of family sized dwellinghouses demonstrably outweighs the benefits of the proposed flats.&nbsp;As such, the proposal would conflict with the following policies which seek to ensure that the borough&#39;s housing supply meets the needs of its residents:National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December, 2024)Policies D6, H1, H2, H9 and&nbsp;H10 of the London Plan (March 2021);Policies SPDG 1,&nbsp;SP3 and DMH5 of The Barking and Dagenham Local Plan (September, 2024)DCLG Technical Housing Standards (nationally described space standard) (DCLG, March 2015) (as amended)"
  ],
